    "name": "Life Dash",
    "steam_appid": 3589130,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Stay Connected</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589130/extras/526f7333a669aa9b1c3d0e31c155ffcf.avif?t=1755251670\" width=1312 height=736 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life Dash is your ticket to an exciting cartoon world where you race to build your dream life\u2014faster than your friends! In this playful yet strategic life-sim, every decision matters, from choosing what to eat, where to work, when to study, and how to invest your money. Can you master life's balancing act and reach your dreams faster than anyone else?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live, Learn, Earn, Repeat!</strong><br>Each week is a turn, packed with choices: get a job, upgrade your skills, buy food, or maybe risk it all on gold, stocks, or commodities. Every action you take moves the clock forward, bringing new opportunities\u2014and surprises\u2014your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Colorful Cartoon World</strong><br>Dive into a vibrant world filled with charming characters, fun mini-quests, and delightful surprises that make every turn fresh and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Own Strategy</strong><br>Play it safe or take risks! Invest wisely, upgrade your career, or focus on happiness\u2014how you play is entirely up to you. Each path offers unique rewards and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weekly Decision-Making:</strong> Make choices on work, study, spending, investing, and more, shaping your character's future week by week.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Quests:</strong> Complete goal-based and time-based quests that boost your happiness and help you learn the ropes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cartoon-style World:</strong> A colorful, inviting world to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friendly Competition:</strong> Reach your life goals in the least number of weeks\u2014compare your record time with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn While You Play:</strong> Develop real-world skills, from financial literacy to effective decision-making.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Life Dash and start turning everyday choices into a thrilling journey to success. Your future awaits\u2014how fast can you get there?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life Dash is your ticket to an exciting cartoon world where you race to build your dream life\u2014faster than your friends! In this playful yet strategic life-sim, every decision matters, from choosing what to eat, where to work, when to study, and how to invest your money. Can you master life's balancing act and reach your dreams faster than anyone else?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live, Learn, Earn, Repeat!</strong><br>Each week is a turn, packed with choices: get a job, upgrade your skills, buy food, or maybe risk it all on gold, stocks, or commodities. Every action you take moves the clock forward, bringing new opportunities\u2014and surprises\u2014your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Colorful Cartoon World</strong><br>Dive into a vibrant world filled with charming characters, fun mini-quests, and delightful surprises that make every turn fresh and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Own Strategy</strong><br>Play it safe or take risks! Invest wisely, upgrade your career, or focus on happiness\u2014how you play is entirely up to you. Each path offers unique rewards and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weekly Decision-Making:</strong> Make choices on work, study, spending, investing, and more, shaping your character's future week by week.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Quests:</strong> Complete goal-based and time-based quests that boost your happiness and help you learn the ropes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cartoon-style World:</strong> A colorful, inviting world to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friendly Competition:</strong> Reach your life goals in the least number of weeks\u2014compare your record time with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn While You Play:</strong> Develop real-world skills, from financial literacy to effective decision-making.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Life Dash and start turning everyday choices into a thrilling journey to success. Your future awaits\u2014how fast can you get there?</p>",
